  "profile": {
    "description": "Pro Link Systems has delivered managed IT services to Los Angeles businesses since 1999. From Woodland Hills to Downtown LA, we serve as the complete IT department for companies with 5 or more employees — providing 24/7 live help desk support, cybersecurity, cloud infrastructure, disaster recovery, and virtual CIO strategy under one flat-rate agreement. No long-term contracts.\nUnlike break-fix IT companies, we monitor and manage your environment proactively so problems don't start. Real engineers answer your calls around the clock — no ticket queues, no offshore support. We are HIPAA, PCI, CMMC, and SOC 2 compliant and serve clients across healthcare, legal, manufacturing, aerospace, hospitality, and entertainment.\nCall 1-800-890-6133"
  },
